WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.088 --> 00:00:03.829
Moments ago, Israel launched Operation
Rising Lion.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:13.212
A few hours earlier, at the Nevatim
military base in southern Israel, nearly

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:15.212
200 aircraft had taken off.

00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:16.092
The scale of the raid was unprecedented.

00:00:16.372 --> 00:00:22.854
There were radar planes for the detection
and protection of the raid, and of course,

00:00:22.854 --> 00:00:24.854
refueling planes,

00:00:24.854 --> 00:00:29.056
because we have a distance of more than
1,500 km So, yeah.

00:00:29.476 --> 00:00:30.216
Israel and Iran.

00:00:30.256 --> 00:00:36.419
So it's really a very massive raid as we
hadn't seen in the 21st century.

00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:43.282
This is one of the most impressive
military operations in modern times.

00:00:43.642 --> 00:00:48.364
With formidable efficiency, the IDF
neutralised Iran's air defence systems.

00:00:49.104 --> 00:00:54.427
They destroyed Russian S-400s, which are
part of the best anti-aircraft batteries,

00:00:54.647 --> 00:00:59.953
which allowed them to conquer Totally
Iranian sky.

00:00:59.954 --> 00:01:04.114
Caught off guard, Iran sent its kamikaze
drones into the sky.

00:01:04.474 --> 00:01:08.095
But they were immediately destroyed by
Israeli combat helicopters.

00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:13.796
Cornered, the leaders of the Revolutionary
Guard Air Force then made a serious

00:01:13.796 --> 00:01:15.796
mistake.

00:01:15.796 --> 00:01:17.277
They decided to meet to organise a
counter-attack.

00:01:19.098 --> 00:01:22.199
The trap set by the IDF was closing in on
them.

00:01:23.819 --> 00:01:26.500
They sent encrypted false...

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:33.902
messages to these commanders of the
Iranian IRGC and they brought them

00:01:33.902 --> 00:01:35.902
together to

00:01:35.902 --> 00:01:37.902
the same bunker.

00:01:37.902 --> 00:01:41.984
There were agents also near the locations
in order to ensure that indeed they are

00:01:41.984 --> 00:01:43.984
there

00:01:43.984 --> 00:01:45.645
and then the Israeli Air Force bombed the
place.

00:01:50.707 --> 00:01:55.708
They are aiming at what we call the C2,
that is to say the command system, the

00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:55.769
fact.

00:01:56.044 --> 00:01:58.845
To target the command at once,

00:01:58.846 --> 00:02:04.848
it allows you to create a surprise effect
and it also causes fear.

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:13.532
In retaliation, the Iranian regime fired
more than 500 ballistic missiles at

00:02:13.532 --> 00:02:13.693
Israel.

00:02:13.953 --> 00:02:16.694
Around 50 of them reached the heart of Tel
Aviv.

00:02:19.075 --> 00:02:20.756
Israel retaliated in turn.

00:02:25.804 --> 00:02:32.489
It attacked all the symbols of the Islamic
Republic, including the state television

00:02:32.489 --> 00:02:34.489
station, Irib News.

00:02:35.331 --> 00:02:39.934
Leading figures from the regime were
simply taken out in their Tehran homes.

00:02:41.355 --> 00:02:47.759
You could see large towers, and at the top
of them were ultra-luxurious apartments,

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:51.742
so held by the regime's great ponts.

00:02:53.303 --> 00:02:57.839
During the 12 days of war, Around 30
high-ranking officials were assassinated.

